   "txt": "### 1. Most Important Fact\nThe Ministry of New and Renewable Energy (MNRE), on behalf of the President of India, has appointed **Shri Manoneet Dalal (DIN: 10059661)** as a **Non-Official Director (Independent Director)** on the Board of IREDA for a term of **3 (three) years** effective **August 18, 2026** (as stated in the filing) or until further orders, whichever is earlier.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Key Numbers\n* **Financials/Order Values:** None reported (this filing pertains exclusively to a board appointment).\n\n---\n\n### 3. Management Guidance / Outlook\n* No forward-looking statements or operational guidance provided in the filing.\n\n---\n\n### 4. What a Shareholder Should Watch or Act On\n* **No action required.** This is a routine regulatory disclosure regarding board composition and corporate governance compliance. \n* Monitor future board/committee reconstitutions (e.g., Audit Committee) where the appointee's 20+ years of legal and financial consulting background (ex-Deloitte, EY) may be utilized.\n\n---\n\n### 5. One-Line Net Read\n* **Neutral**: Routine governance appointment of an independent director with taxation and advisory expertise; has no direct financial or operational impact."
